    {
      "id": "ov.keep_dry",
      "criterion": "phrasing",
      "problem": "\"Mantenga seco\" leaves the thing to keep dry unsaid. Spanish needs an object here, and the masculine \"seco\" does not match the feminine nouns used for the spot everywhere else (la zona, la incisión, la herida), so the label reads as cut off. It also no longer matches the sentence in wc.03.",
      "suggestion": "Mantenga la zona seca hasta 3 días después de la cirugía"
    }
